        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Perianal irritation and a small amount of soft stool externally. Good tone. Rectum loaded with a large amount of firm stool; no discrete mass, fissures, haemorrhoids, or fresh blood seen. Chaperone present."
